@direction LR
@spacing 60

[1 - A couple sends an enquiry, and it lands on your Monday consultations board] -> [2 - They get an email right away with a link to book a tasting]
[2 - They get an email right away with a link to book a tasting] -> [3 - They book a tasting in Square, and Zapier adds the date to their Monday item]
[3 - They book a tasting in Square, and Zapier adds the date to their Monday item] -> [4 - After the tasting, you add the design, tiers, flavors and servings]
[4 - After the tasting, you add the design, tiers, flavors and servings] -> [5 - They pay the deposit in Square, and Zapier marks them Booked in Monday]
[5 - They pay the deposit in Square, and Zapier marks them Booked in Monday] -> [6 - No deposit yet? Monday reminds you to follow up with them]
[6 - No deposit yet? Monday reminds you to follow up with them] -> [7 - Booked cakes move to your deliveries board with the venue and setup time]
[7 - Booked cakes move to your deliveries board with the venue and setup time] -> [8 - Before your due date, Monday checks the final balance came in through Square]
[8 - Before your due date, Monday checks the final balance came in through Square] -> [9 - On the day, your driver sees the delivery list in the Monday app]
[9 - On the day, your driver sees the delivery list in the Monday app] -> [10 - At the venue, a setup photo goes on the item and it's marked Delivered]
[10 - At the venue, a setup photo goes on the item and it's marked Delivered] -> [11 - After the wedding, the couple gets a thank-you email asking for a review]
